{"meta":{"id":"array","category":"it/syntax/javascript/object","title":"배열 · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"배열 선언, map · filter · reduce, 스프레드 · 구조 분해","tags":["javascript","f-array"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">배열 · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 배열 선언, map · filter · reduce, 스프레드 · 구조 분해</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">배열</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const nums = [1, 2, 3];\r\nconst mixed = [1, &quot;a&quot;, true];     // 타입 섞어도 됨\r\n\r\nnums.push(4);                     // 뒤에 추가\r\nnums.length;                      // 4\r\nnums.includes(2);                 // true</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">new Array · 여러 종류 값 · forEach</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">let arr = new Array();            // = []\r\narr = [&#x27;문자자료&#x27;, 5, [2, 4, 6, 8], { tel: &#x27;010-1234-5678&#x27; }, function () { console.log(&#x27;안녕하세요&#x27;); }];\r\narr[0];                           // &#x27;문자자료&#x27;\r\narr[4]();                         // 배열 안의 함수 실행\r\n\r\narr.forEach(function (value, index, array) {   // 값, 인덱스 번호, 배열 전체\r\n  console.log(index, value);\r\n});</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">배열에 문자 · 숫자 · 배열 · 객체 · 함수를 함께 넣을 수 있다</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">자주 쓰는 메서드</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">nums.map((n) =&gt; n * 2);           // [2, 4, 6, 8]   새 배열\r\nnums.filter((n) =&gt; n % 2 === 0);  // [2, 4]\r\nnums.find((n) =&gt; n &gt; 2);          // 3\r\nnums.reduce((a, b) =&gt; a + b, 0);  // 10\r\n[...nums, 5];                     // 스프레드 복사\r\nconst [first, ...rest] = nums;    // 구조 분해</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 배열 (number[]) · 튜플</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/object/array","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/javascript/object"}],"hasImage":false}